⭐ CosmaCare Supabase Triggers + Workers (Layer‑4)
Full system for syncing blockchain → Supabase → API Gateway → Realtime → Apps
1️⃣ Purpose of Supabase Triggers + Workers
Supabase triggers + workers exist to:

Mirror on‑chain events into Supabase tables

Keep bookings, settlements, disputes, rewards in sync

Emit realtime events to web/mobile apps

Provide analytics for Layer‑5 CosmaVision

Provide fraud detection signals for Layer‑6 NeoVision

Provide compliance + reporting for Layer‑7 CosmaEnterprise

This is how CosmaCare becomes production‑grade.

2️⃣ Architecture Overview
Code
Layer‑1 Contracts → Layer‑3 API Gateway → Supabase Workers → Supabase Tables → Realtime Events → Web/Mobile Apps → Layer‑5/6/7 Analytics
Supabase workers listen to:

Layer‑1 contract events

